{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51637","headline":"送季大夫牧舒州 · 汤悦","name":"送季大夫牧舒州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"却下乌台建隼旟，侯封归去袭龙舒。\n严霜尚满辞天阙，甘雨看随入境车。\n（《舆地纪胜》四六《安庆府》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"汤悦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51637.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51637","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}